#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [rustworkx](https://www.rustworkx.org/) package contains a large library of different graphs and enables the creation of custom graphs.  The visually interesting code below creates a backend inspired by the toric code. You can then visualize the backend using the functions from the [Visualize backends](#visualize-backends) section.\n"
